# This repository is a CURATED release. It was assembled by copying only the
# core code, the experimental data, the result files of record, and the computed
# structures needed to reproduce the paper's claims. The large regenerable
# artifacts and third-party data below are deliberately NOT part of the release;
# this file also prevents them from being re-added by accident.

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
*.swp

# --- logs / scratch ---
*.log
logs/
tmp.*
*.tmp

# --- Third-party data that must NOT be redistributed (see LICENSE) ---
# The KROGER hybrid-functional defect database (Arnab et al., PCCP 2025) is
# consumed numerically under citation; its raw records are never shipped.
**/external/KROGER/
**/kroger_ga2o3_092724.npz
**/kroger_ga2o3_092724_numeric.npz
# QE ONCV pseudopotentials are third-party.
**/*.upf
**/*.UPF

# --- Large regenerable artifacts (NOT part of the release) ---
# Raw QE/HSE calculation outputs (75 GB), MP structures, LLM adapters, etc.
**/dft/qe_cc/
**/data/raw/
**/data/processed/
**/checkpoints/*.bin

# Local outputs from the CPC entry points.
cpc/.venv/
cpc/runs/
cpc/replay_runs/
cpc/**/external/KROGER/
cpc/**/kroger_ga2o3_092724*.npz
# Article inputs and saved verification records are tracked; regenerated artwork
# and local caches remain excluded. Only the selected replay dependencies below
# are released from the much larger historical research results tree.
cpc/figures/
cpc/tables/
cpc/audit/
cpc/research/data/**
!cpc/research/data/physics_reference/
!cpc/research/data/physics_reference/fermi_half_v1.npz
